;|*** /*      SUBROUTINE PROPAGATE_DELETE_UP (UP)
;|*** C******* SPECIFICATIONS ***********************************************
;|*** C*                                                                    *
;|*** C*       PROGRAM SUMMARY                                              *
;|*** C*       ------- -------                                              *
;|*** C*                                                                    *
;|*** C*                                                                    *
;|*** C*       ARGUMENT DESCRIPTION                                         *
;|*** C*       -------- -----------                                         *
